===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|droschel}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|drōscala}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*þrustalǭ}}, possibly altered from or a diminutive of {{m|gem-pro|*þurstaz}}. The modern consonantism is [[Central German|Central]] and [[Low German]] (compare {{etyl|gml|de}} {{m|gml|drōsle}}, from {{etyl|osx|de}} {{m|osx|thrōsla}}). Compare English {{m|en|throstle}}.

